@startuml BlackoutRadar_SecurityFlow

title BlackoutRadar — Security Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5

actor User

participant "REST API" as API
participant "Security Layer" as Security
participant "Authentication Service" as Auth
database "Refresh Token Store" as Tokens
participant "Business Service" as Service

== Login ==

User -> API : Login request

API -> Auth : Authenticate

Auth --> API : Access Token + Refresh Token

API --> User : JWT

== Authorized request ==

User -> API : Request + JWT

API -> Security : Validate JWT

alt JWT valid

    Security -> Service : Authenticated request

    Service --> API : Response

    API --> User : Success

else JWT expired

    Security --> API : Unauthorized

    API --> User : 401 Unauthorized

end

== Refresh Token ==

User -> API : Refresh request

API -> Tokens : Validate Refresh Token

alt Refresh Token valid

    Tokens --> API : OK

    API --> User : New JWT

else Refresh Token invalid

    Tokens --> API : Invalid

    API --> User : Login required

end

@enduml